{"schema_version":1,"event_id":"bob-cli-dm.7.1:000020:note_appended:bob-cli-dm.7.1.2:de64378ed4e5268aa49f1ab3bc9d6cc96f28217678681664e715a3b321a2cb06","timestamp":"2026-10-29T03:31:40Z","actor":"bob-cli-dm.7.1.2","operation":"note_appended","issue_id":"bob-cli-dm.7.1.2","payload":{"kind":"note_appended","entry":"Implemented card-theme-edit in bob-plugins: t/Enter opens a Theme stage (Use default first with inherited reason, then Today/Recent/typed new, deduped, query/selection preserved; unknown inherited selectable), Ctrl+D on the Theme row clears to default via clear-theme intent (field clearing, never hide), t added to repeated-action suppression. Direct-edit planner validates typed names, uses catalog spelling, enforces single non-exempt component, Use-default/inherited clears, same-key no-op, repair handling. Guarded local/counted/linked writes use only setTaskTheme/clearTaskTheme with identity+line preimage and inherited revalidation, one undo for local/counted, per-note guarded writes with honest partial failures for linked; closed tasks skipped, no status/link/ID/freshness/schedule/WorkLog/walk effects, review walk suppressed. Updated model/view expectations, added scripts/test-navigation-task-card-theme-edit.cjs (8 tests), registered in package.json, updated docs/task-card.md and docs/bob-navigation-hotkeys.md. Verified: npm run build + build:check clean, 126 focused task-card tests pass, full npm test 4156 pass, npm run validate clean, npm run docs:check passed. Deploy: bob plugins sync for bob-navigation-hotkeys refused by provenance guard (deployed from uncommitted build in workspace bob-cli_14, c59819c); did not force with -F, left for land agent. No manual desktop verification (Obsidian UI not reachable); header/pill/t/Enter/Ctrl+D/cancellation covered by tests."}}
